1 (sintetico, generable)          n=2000  MDE_int(icc2)=  8.9 pts\nmulti-hop 3-aguja (sintetico)          n=1000  MDE_int(icc2)= 12.5 pts\npasskey 64k (sintetico)                n=1000  MDE_int(icc2)= 12.5 pts\nInfiniteBench-EN-QA (real, ~215 items) n=215   MDE_int(icc2)= 27.0 pts\nLongBench subconj. (real, ~300)        n=300   MDE_int(icc2)= 22.9 pts\n", "output_truncated": false}"}], "is_error": false, "kind": "BenchmarkObservation"}, "action_id": "430c3dd9-4aaa-4af7-9ec5-7716cfa7bffa", "extended_content": [], "kind": "ObservationEvent"}
{"id": "14d29c5d-bd46-470c-9d80-d885350869c6", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T20:10:53.479313", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "16f119e1-54d1-4c1c-988e-f567cd78d596", "thought": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "Tablas verificadas con aritmética explícita (no es un experimento: son presupuestos de diseño). Dos hallazgos que cambian el diseño y que incorporo:

1. **E1 a presupuesto fijo colapsa el factor L** para unidades compactas (u=1–4 a T_ret=512 permite recuperar *todos* los bloques → no hay decisión de búsqueda). El corte iso-cómputo y el iso-cobertura deben informarse **como pareja**, y su diferencia es en sí el diagnóstico.
2. **Los benchmarks reales (215–300 ítems) no tienen potencia para L×U** (MDE ≈ 23–27 pts). La interacción vive solo en tareas sintéticas con n≥2000."}], "reasoning_content": "The power analysis is crucial: real benchmarks (215-300 items) cannot detect interaction effects below ~23-27 points → so the interaction test must live on synthetic tasks with n=2000-5000, and real benchmarks are for external validity of main effects only. This is a strong design decision backed by arithmetic.

Now write the complete design as stage=result.

Let me structure it well:

0. Status & scope
1. Interfaces defined by us (lookup L, unit U) — since repo empty
2. Factors and levels (with 2×2 core + grid)
